Grammar

    0 $accept: Program $end

    1 Program: CLASS IDENTIFIER LBRACE MemberList RBRACE

    2 MemberList: ε
    3           | MemberList MethodDecl
    4           | MemberList FieldDecl
    5           | MemberList SEMICOLON

    6 MethodDecl: PUBLIC STATIC MethodHeader MethodBody

    7 FieldDecl: PUBLIC STATIC Type IDENTIFIER IdentifierList SEMICOLON
    8          | error SEMICOLON

    9 IdentifierList: ε
   10               | IdentifierList COMMA IDENTIFIER

   11 Type: BOOL
   12     | INT
   13     | DOUBLE

   14 MethodHeader: Type IDENTIFIER LPAR RPAR
   15             | Type IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParams RPAR
   16             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR RPAR
   17             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR FormalParams RPAR

   18 FormalParams: ParamList
   19             | STRING LSQ RSQ IDENTIFIER

   20 ParamList: Type IDENTIFIER
   21          | ParamList COMMA Type IDENTIFIER

   22 MethodBody: LBRACE StatementOrVarDecl RBRACE

   23 StatementOrVarDecl: ε
   24                   | StatementOrVarDecl Statement
   25                   | StatementOrVarDecl VarDecl

   26 VarDecl: Type IDENTIFIER IdentifierList SEMICOLON

   27 Statement: LBRACE StatementList RBRACE
   28          | IF LPAR Expr RPAR Statement
   29          | IF LPAR Expr RPAR Statement ELSE Statement
   30          | WHILE LPAR Expr RPAR Statement
   31          | RETURN SEMICOLON
   32          | RETURN Expr SEMICOLON
   33          | SEMICOLON
   34          | MethodInvocation SEMICOLON
   35          | Assignment SEMICOLON
   36          | ParseArgs SEMICOLON
   37          | PRINT LPAR Expr RPAR SEMICOLON
   38          | PRINT LPAR STRLIT RPAR SEMICOLON
   39          | error SEMICOLON

   40 StatementList: ε
   41              | StatementList Statement

   42 MethodInvocation: IDENTIFIER LPAR RPAR
   43                 | IDENTIFIER LPAR ArgList RPAR
   44                 | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR

   45 ArgList: Expr
   46        | ArgList COMMA Expr

   47 Assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN Expr

   48 ParseArgs: PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ Expr RSQ RPAR
   49          | PARSEINT LPAR error RPAR

   50 Expr: Expr PLUS Expr
   51     | Expr MINUS Expr
   52     | Expr STAR Expr
